}
`;

exports[`the sqs queue input given: [case3] a consumer reaches perBatch through the family object when: [t0] a batch of three arrives, one poison and one unparseable then: sqs reads only msg-1 to retry; the refused msg-2 is absent, so deleted 1`] = `
